
### Create a water resource
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vellore Main Reservoir",
  "resourceType": "Reservoir",
  "location": "Vellore",
  "capacityM3": 100000,
  "currentLevelM3": 75000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Get all water resources
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources
